{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2023-06-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'TIMESAVER! ALASKA AIRLINES AND CLEAR TEAM UP TO MAKE TRAVEL EASIER AND MORE SECURE', 'text': 'WITH CLEAR PLUS, MOVE THROUGH AIRPORT SECURITY LINES FASTER; MILEAGE PLAN MEMBERS CAN NOW ENROLL FOR A CLEAR PLUS MEMBERSHIP AT A REDUCED RATE AND RECEIVE BONUS MILES\xa0 SEATTLE , JUNE 21, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0OUR COMMITMENT TO CARE FOR OUR GUESTS COMES IN ALL FORMS, INCLUDING IMPROVING THEIR TRAVEL DAY. TO HELP DO THAT, ALASKA AIRLINES IS PARTNERING WITH CLEAR – THE SECURE IDENTITY COMPANY – TO PROVIDE FRICTION-FREE AND PREDICTABLE TRAVEL EXPERIENCES WITH CLEAR PLUS.'}